### Criar um NPC
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/entities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Elara, a Tecelã de Segredos",
  "type": "NPC",
  "lore": "A dona da taverna 'Corvo Cego'. Ela sabe quem entra e sai de Lamúria e vende essas informações pelo preço certo.",
  "image_url": "https://url-do-supabase.com/elara-npc.png",
  "stats": {
    "armor_class": 12,
    "hit_points": "22 (4d8 + 4)",
    "speed": "9 m.",
    "attributes": {
      "STR": 10,
      "DEX": 14,
      "CON": 12,
      "INT": 16,
      "WIS": 16,
      "CHA": 18
    },
    "skills": ["Deception +6", "Insight +5", "Persuasion +6"],
    "languages": ["Common", "Thieves' Cant"],
    "challenge_rating": "1 (200 XP)",
    "actions": [
      {
        "name": "Adaga Escondida",
        "type": "Melee Weapon Attack",
        "hit": "+4",
        "reach": "1.5 m.",
        "damage": "4 (1d4 + 2) piercing damage"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### Adicionar a "Lâmina Sugadora de Almas" (ID 2) aos drops do "Senhor da Podridão" (ID 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/entities/2/drops/2

